# Parameterized type alias used as constructor
# The [type [let a b] Body] form creates a type alias with params
# In value position, the constructor (e.g., Pair) is a nominal variant constructor

Result: [type [let t e] [Ok value: t] | [Err error: e]]
success: [Ok value: 42]
failure: [Err error: "not found"]
success.value
=== out
42
